// Coimbatore drops the "paid-outdated-vs-free-updated-assessments" row (index
// 3, already carried directly by the page's own single AssessmentSupportNote)
// and the "generic low-paying path advice" row (index 4, the weakest fit for
// a precision-engineering manufacturing economy that is already high-value,
// not low-paying). Index 1 (degree-first-vs-skill-first) is deliberately
// KEPT, unlike Ludhiana - Coimbatore's pump, textile-machinery, and
// auto-component manufacturing is precision-engineering work that genuinely
// expects an engineering degree, so the degree-vs-skill framing fits here in
// a way it does not fit Ludhiana's hosiery/bicycle karobar economy. The
// resulting selection (rows 0, 1, 2, 5) is a combination not used by any
// sibling: Rajkot (rows 0-4), Vizag (rows 1-5), Bangalore (full library),
// Pune (drops index 3), Kolkata (drops index 1), Chennai (drops index 5),
// Hyderabad (drops index 2), Mumbai/Chandigarh/Gurgaon/Nagpur (each drop
// index 4), Delhi (drops 0 and 5), Ahmedabad (drops 3 and 5), Surat (drops 0
// and 3), Thane/Vadodara (drop 1 and 3), Ludhiana (drops 1 and 4), Guwahati
// (drops 2 and 4), Jalandhar (drops 2 and 5), Raipur (drops 2 and 3), Nashik
// (drops 1 and 2), Aurangabad (drops 0 and 4), Kolhapur (drops 0 and 2), and
// Noida (drops 1, 3, and 4 - a three-index combination, not the same pair
// used here).
const coimbatoreComparisonRows = BOFU_COMPARISON_LIBRARY.filter(
  (_, index) => index !== 3 && index !== 4,
);

const title = 'Career Counselling in Coimbatore | Online Guidance Across India | Future Career School';
const description =
