---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Coimbatore</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Coimbatore
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career Counselling in <span class="gold-text">Coimbatore</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Coimbatore has earned its names - the Pump City, the Manchester of South India - by building one of the world's genuinely significant precision-engineering
        manufacturing bases, anchored by CRI Pumps, Texmo Industries, Kirloskar Brothers, Lakshmi Machine Works, Pricol, and Roots Industries. For a large share of
        Coimbatore's engineering families, that means a career decision is rarely a blank slate. It is a choice between joining, modernising, or stepping outside a
        family pump, textile-machinery, or auto-component business that has often run for a generation or more already. The question worth answering deliberately
        is whether a genuine high-value skill portfolio - inside that business, alongside it, or entirely apart from it - can unlock high income opportunities and
        earlier financial freedom that the inherited default never gets you to on its own.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-sub hero-sub-secondary">
        Guidance is delivered fully online across Coimbatore - from a home near Peelamedu's pump-manufacturing belt to a hostel room near PSG Tech or Amrita's
        campus - and across India, so you can start wherever you already are without adding another commute to an already crowded family decision.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="intent-clarity"
    title="Why this decision already feels heavier here"
